    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 917 PM MDT, Doppler radar was tracking showers and thunderstorms with strong wind gusts along a line extending from 32 miles northeast of Sunburst to 18 miles east of Conrad. Movement was east at 35 mph. HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Locations impacted include... Chester, Joplin, Inverness, Lothair, Rudyard, Whitlash, Tiber Dam, Devon, and Galata.",
